# A nine-slice frame: 16x16 with a 4px border. Every button and panel in the
# scaffolded game comes out of this one file at whatever size the layout wants.
#
# Corners never scale, edges repeat along one axis, the middle repeats along
# both — which is why the light lives on the top edge and the shadow on the
# bottom. Stretch it to any size and it still reads as lit from above.
#
# Wire it up in TitleState by overriding ButtonFrame; see any sample.
name KnockItOff-ui-frame
size 16 16
key o outline
key H slate-3-hilite
key M slate-2
key D slate-1
key d slate-0-shadow
pixels
oooooooooooooooo
oHHHHHHHHHHHHHHo
oHMMMMMMMMMMMMHo
oHMDDDDDDDDDDMHo
*8 oHMDddddddddDMHo
oHMDDDDDDDDDDMHo
oHMMMMMMMMMMMMHo
oMMMMMMMMMMMMMMo
oooooooooooooooo
